# RON: Rusty Object Notation grammar (ron-rs/ron, docs/grammar.md); requirements/languages/ron.md
name     ron

builtin  true false Some None

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   " "  : escapes multiline
escape        : x=2 u-braces
number        : no-leading-dot
key-names  :
upper-type
hook     rust
